  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Serbia European Commission Hybrid Trust Fund for Survey of Income and Living Conditions (SILC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main development objective of this TF is to support the RSO (Republic Statistical Office) in developing the capacity and the systems necessary to ensure a successful running of SILC (Survey of Income and Living Condition -- the household survey developed by the European Union to measure poverty and social inclusion) and to run the SILC survey for 2 years.</narrative>
  </description>
